  "sourceContracts": [
    "PlayerFrame is a SecureUnitButtonTemplate and EditModePlayerFrameSystemTemplate on all inspected targets",
    "GetHitRectInsets returns four uiUnit numbers without secret annotations in the inspected declarations",
    "SetHitRectInsets is protected; Retail/Forever disallow secret arguments; only known constants/saved public values are passed",
    "Existing ordinary mouse helper skips initially secret switches; the binding scan previously ignored suppression policy"
  ],
